Subject: [PATCH 1/3] docs(process): add test-placement, crate-edge and
 app-scope rules

AGENTS.md "Code shape" gains the app-scope and crate-dependency rules,
"Testing" gains the test-placement rule and no longer calls
crates/app/tests "app + commands". The PR-reviewer checklist and the
work-issue skill name the three rules. PROCESS_VERSION 16 -> 17.

Fixes #920
